  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUNDING TO WFP FOR 2024 ZAMBIA DROUGHT RESPONSE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia is experiencing prolonged dry spells because of the El Ni&#xf1;o weather phenomenon, which has exacerbated the food insecurity status and increased the risk of illness and death associated with food insecurity. Through the provision of this once-off grant, WFP will contribute to: Complementing the Government&#x2019;s response to the drought by providing additional emergency cash transfers to an estimated 79,000 households (475,000 people) in the 16 districts.Under the UN Multi-Hazard Preparedness and Response Plan, WFP is leading on Food Security and Agriculture, with provision of complementary food assistance, capacity building, monitoring, and logistics/procurement support.</narrative>
  </description>
